    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Visual Novel with anime aesthetics. Romance, adventure, betrayals, employment, social relationships. Choose your own adventure. Many options will lead you to meet many characters. Hiroshi is a rebellious young man who lives in a small town where he always has problems with the police. His parents decide to pay for a trip to the island of Shikoku so he can find a job, meet a girl to fall in love with, and become a responsible person. Once on the island, Hiroshi is at your command to make the best decisions for his life. Each decision is a story, and there are many stories and adventures to discover both on the island and beyond. You decide Hiroshi's future.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Visual Novel with anime aesthetics. Romance, adventure, betrayals, employment, social relationships. Choose your own adventure. Many options will lead you to meet many characters. Hiroshi is a rebellious young man who lives in a small town where he always has problems with the police. His parents decide to pay for a trip to the island of Shikoku so he can find a job, meet a girl to fall in love with, and become a responsible person. Once on the island, Hiroshi is at your command to make the best decisions for his life. Each decision is a story, and there are many stories and adventures to discover both on the island and beyond. You decide Hiroshi's future.</p>",
    "short_description": "A romantic and adventure visual novel where your decisions are very important.",
